{"id":"conv_04713","context":"A uni student interviews a doctor about clinical research","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["ren_uni","saito_doctor"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Doctor, thank you for your time today. As a medical student, I have several questions about clinical research.","jp":"先生、本日はお忙しい中ありがとうございます。臨床研究について、医学生として伺いたいことがいくつかあります。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[3,6,14,15,16,22,39,49,55,62,75,94,200,228,492,739,944,1896,2284,2337,2391,2578,2861,5035,5401,5804,9114,9154,9209,11349,11758,11824],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お忙しい","r":"おいそがしい","w":11824},{"s":"中","r":"ちゅう","w":55},{"s":"ありがとう","w":492},{"s":"ござい","w":94},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"},{"s":"臨床","r":"りんしょう","w":5035},{"s":"研究","r":"けんきゅう","w":200},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"、"},{"s":"医学","r":"いがく","w":2578},{"s":"生","r":"せい","w":739},{"s":"として","w":49},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":11758},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"いくつ","w":2284},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"あり","w":22},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"saito_doctor","mood":null,"en":"Please, don't hold back. The development of new pharmaceuticals requires the interest of younger generations.","jp":"どうぞ、遠慮なく。新しい医薬品の開発には、若い世代の関心が欠かせませんからね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,6,14,20,26,51,54,57,245,339,340,1055,1454,1616,1626,2861,6158,6927,9856,10042,12608,17418],"jpTokens":[{"s":"どうぞ","w":1626},{"s":"、"},{"s":"遠慮なく","r":"えんりょなく","w":17418},{"s":"。"},{"s":"新しい","r":"あたらしい","w":339},{"s":"医薬品","r":"いやくひん","w":6927},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"開発","r":"かいはつ","w":340},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"世代","r":"せだい","w":1454},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"関心","r":"かんしん","w":1616},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"欠か","r":"かか","w":12608},{"s":"せ","w":245},{"s":"ませ","w":14},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":nu